	quest.0C83115865AC72DF.title: "Website"
	quest.0F3AA93C73E3986C.quest_desc: [
		"This &6Questbook&r has a very simple quest system."
		"In fact a &8quest&r by default does not require a &7&ldependancy&r so you can do it right now or later, up to you to decide."
		""
		"As you can see, the majority of quests does need a &7&ldependancy&r. In order to unlock them, you can click on the &0&l&nGrey Arrow&r to list the needed &7&ldependancy&r or &7&ldependancies&r."
	]
	quest.0F3AA93C73E3986C.quest_subtitle: "Read the F*ck*ng Quests !"
	quest.1416718F40ED7569.quest_desc: [
		"&k&4chroma&r Hello and welcome to &l&n&bChroma Endless&r! &4&kchroma&r"
		""
		"&l&n&bChroma Endless&r is the sequel of the other &l&n&bChroma&r modpacks, with &aTechnology&r, &aMagic&r and &aExploration&r mods; but this time, in &lexpert mode&r! A lot of recipes have been changed to make progress more difficult. There are also &lnew machinery&r to enhance your adventure."
		""
		"This is an &lexpert modpack&r, but even if you are a &lbeginner&r, you can play as the &lquests&r will help you a lot, and you can also join the &lDiscord server&r for &lsupport&r."
		""
		"This &lQuests Book&r is made to guide you all along your survival adventure, but isn't &lmandatory&r."
		""
		"                             &3&lHave fun!&r"
		"The Chroma Team has taken possession of endless, you must rescue it. Through the different ages of the story, learn from it more and more in order to save it!"
	]
	quest.1416718F40ED7569.quest_subtitle: "A brand new hardcore adventure!"
	quest.1416718F40ED7569.title: "Welcome to Chroma Endless!"
	quest.1CA9744CB5D85432.quest_desc: [
		"To share your quests with your friends, you need to create a team."
		""
		"To do this, execute this command :"
		"&a/ftbteams party create"
		""
		"To invite your friends, execute this command :"
		"&b/ftbteams party invite &dName"
		""
		"Your friends just have to accept, and you are now in a team."
	]
	quest.2148C47C03622790.quest_subtitle: "&6Obtain when &aleft click &6on &abedrock"
	quest.262CEB2DAAA6DB6F.quest_desc: [
		"BisectHosting offers simple, fast and high quality server hosting with over a dozen locations available worldwide, guaranteeing low latency. After your purchase, the server is already configured and ready to use."
		""
		"Use the code \"&l&bCHROMATECH&r\" to get 25% off your first month as a new customer for one of their game servers."
	]
	quest.262CEB2DAAA6DB6F.quest_subtitle: "Promo code : &l&aCHROMATECH&r   "
	quest.2826677ED26D1D5C.quest_desc: [
		"FTB Chunks allows you to &4claim chunks&r to &4protect&r your blocks. It also has a &9minimap and large map&r ! You can find it in the top left corner of your inventory."
		""
		"&6Right-click&r anywhere in map to create a waypoint."
		""
		"&6Right-click&r on waypoints and death points to edit or delete them."
		""
		"Click on &1Claimed Chunks button&r, then left or &6right-click&r on map to select chunks that will belong to you. &6Shift-left&r or &6right-click&r on claimed chunks to toggle forceloading."
	]
	quest.2826677ED26D1D5C.title: "Chunks Claiming / Loading"
