	quest.4C99953231A58014.quest_desc: [
		"&6&lUltimine&r is a very useful mod for mining."
		""
		"Indeed, with the ² key (by default) you will see a &nwhite outline&r that we will call the &c&lUltimine Zone&r which represents what you will mine. "
		""
		"This &c&lUltimine Zone&r can be changed. In fact you can see that, if you keep pressing the ² key, you can change the shape of this zone and find the one that suits you best."
	]
